+    "settings_frame": "Use case: ui-mockup. ONE isolated 2D game UI sprite. Match the user's attached lobby UI EXACTLY: simple hand-inked but crisp flat vector, heavy even pure black #000000 outline, solid gold #F2B23A, plum-black #1E1018, cream #F3E2C0 only. Solid flat colours. No gradients, no texture, no painted shading, no lighting or metal sheen, no shadow, no text/letters/numbers. Western pocket-watch clockwork theme, same extreme simplicity as attached gold arrow and watch. Object centred with generous margins on perfectly flat pure green #00FF00 chroma background, no floor or vignette. Asset: settings_frame, empty content-area border ONLY. Outer rectangle aspect1.6:1, final1600x1000. Small clipped/chamfered corners like attached lobby panel. Exact band structure: pure black outer ink10px, flat gold band22px, inner black ink9px. Each of four corners has one small round gold rivet and one TINY simple flat gear/curl within96px from corner. All long straight edges COMPLETELY plain and uniform. Inside is pure green #00FF00, same as outside so it will become fully transparent: NO plum fill! Empty transparent-centre border. Absolutely no watch at top, no dripping gold, no top crest, no chains, no other objects. Symmetrical. Generous green margin all around. Front-facing perfectly flat geometry, no bevels or shading."
+  },
+  "derived_states": {
